          "kicker": "Test options",
          "heading": "Steve Hansen says Mark Nawaqanitawase would be better off playing for Fiji",
          "body": "Former All Blacks coach Sir Steve Hansen has said Mark Nawaqanitawase \"would be better off playing for Fiji\", given his commitments to Japanese club the Saitama Wild Knights. The 26-year-old, who won 11 Australia caps before two years in rugby league with the Sydney Roosters, is still weighing his Test options and is also eligible for Italy and Fiji. Speaking on the Rugby Unity podcast, Hansen said he hopes the wing still plays for Australia. Nawaqanitawase is not in Jake White's 35-man squad."
