          "kicker": "Club rugby",
          "heading": "Club rugby: Ollie Chessum pinches Bristol lineouts as Leicester win 22-16",
          "body": "In Premiership club rugby, Leicester Tigers beat Bristol Bears 22-16 at Ashton Gate on Friday night, going top of the table for now. England hopeful Ollie Chessum was the clear player of the match, with Leicester winning 94 per cent of their own lineout ball to Bristol's 71 per cent. Billy Searle's boot did much of the damage, with three of Leicester's four tries coming off it, two while Bristol were a man short."
