          "heading": "France hit by six major absences before Springboks test in Paris",
          "body": "France's injury problems have deepened ahead of the November Test against South Africa, with reports citing six major absences. One headline frames it as a crisis arriving three weeks before the Springboks resume the rivalry in Paris. The individuals involved are not named in the reporting so far. The storyline was first flagged in mid-October, when SA Rugby Magazine reported a fresh blow for Les Bleus ahead of the Bok clash."
