          "kicker": "Disciplinary ruling",
          "heading": "Tadhg Furlong cleared to play after disciplinary hearing over Gavin Coombes citation",
          "body": "Tadhg Furlong has been cleared to play after his disciplinary hearing over the Gavin Coombes citation. Munster have issued a statement on the outcome and will give Coombes full backing. Ireland's next match is against Argentina, whose 33-man Nations Championship roster, finalised this week, brings back veteran Facundo Isa after missing out on international duty in 2024 and 2026."
