        {
          "kicker": "Captaincy call",
          "heading": "Quesada says Italy captaincy decision comes next week with 17 players injured",
          "body": "Gonzalo Quesada has said Italy will name their captain next week, with 17 players unavailable through injury. Speaking at the launch of the Northern Phase, he said the team has some ideas, pointing to players who have captained before, such as Giacomo Nicotera and Niccolò Cannone, and to others for whom it could be a new opportunity. The choice will depend on the group and who is available. Italy face South Africa in Turin, then Argentina in Genoa and Fiji in Udine before London."
        },
