          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Galindo names Bernasconi-led Argentina XV to face England A in Bath",
          "body": "Álvaro Galindo has named his 27-man Argentina XV for the uncapped match against England A in Bath, headlined by Benetton hooker Bernardo Bernasconi. Harlequins prop Pedro Delgado and Bristol Bears flanker Benjamín Grondona are in the group, both among the players missing from Felipe Contepomi's Los Pumas roster. The XV trained for four days at Hindú Club in Buenos Aires, and the fixture gives players from both sides a chance at call-ups to the test arena."
        },
