          "kicker": "Code switch",
          "heading": "Angus Crichton signs with Waratahs for 2027, switching from NRL to union",
          "body": "Angus Crichton, the Kangaroos and Blues Origin star, signed with the NSW Waratahs for 2027 back in January, a late switch from the NRL ahead of next year's home World Cup. The 29-year-old, who grew up playing union and came close to joining the Western Force after the 2023 World Cup, joins former Roosters teammate Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii at the Tahs, with a get-out clause after the 2027 World Cup. \"It's incredibly exciting to be returning to the sport I played throughout my childhood,\" Crichton said."
        },
