          "kicker": "Ranking record",
          "heading": "Japan's best-ever world ranking is No. 7, set in 2019",
          "body": "Japan's peak in the world rankings is No. 7, reached in 2019. In the Nations Championship so far, Japan have won one of three matches, losing two. Across those three, they have scored 62 points and conceded 88, a points difference of -26. Their most recent result was a 28-34 defeat to Fiji. Wales are the next opponent, in Round 4 of the Nations Championship."
        },
